@@s003 Rules and prohibitions
@@s004 Every exercise sheet starts with the same sentence: <i>"Do not use variables, side effects, exceptions or return statements (unless explicitly asked for)."</i> The compiler does <b>not</b> stop you: <code>var</code> and <code>return</code> compile. The grade does.
